# EXAMPLE sheet: GATEWAY SYSTEM run, Twin chain 918453 (issue 1892). Command: core-stack publish gateway. It writes the real sheet per run, from the vaults run sheet:
# the deployer, pauser, share receiver and release mode of the vaults run, the EMERGENCY key as the gateway admin and the run's own timelock as the gateway upgrade timelock.
# Those two are explicit Twin choices. Production decides its own (docs/architecture.md section 10, open). Public placeholder addresses only.
CHAIN_ID=918453
EXPECTED_CHAIN_ID=918453
ADMIN_ADDRESS=0x000000000000000000000000000000000000a001
PAUSER_ADDRESS=0x000000000000000000000000000000000000a002
SHARE_RECEIVER_ADDRESS=0x000000000000000000000000000000000000a005
UPGRADE_MODE=frozen
GATEWAY_ADMIN_ADDRESS=0x000000000000000000000000000000000000a003
GATEWAY_UPGRADE_TIMELOCK=0x000000000000000000000000000000000000a0c2
